{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS IS A DRAFT COPY MEANT TO BE USED AS A BASIS AS I WORK TO MAKE THE FULL GAME!!!</strong>\u00a0<br><br>&quot;Troy: The Red Winged Hero&quot; is not so different from the first game &quot;Troy: The Soldier&quot;, except now the ideas are more refined and much better put together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - An emphasis on item use, upgrades, and being smart about what you choose to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - A lengthy story, with enough main/optional dialogue to build a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Secret bosses, optional bosses, and post game content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Multiple skins for the player to equip, all unique from one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Loads of catchy tunes to keep the player's ears happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - A more refined art style that gives the player a manga feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Different weapons for each party member that allows use for different spells/skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide array of bosses, enemies, locations, and oddities as you journey through Will playing as the brother to Michael, Liam Newguard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun and stay safe, my perfect clone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- R</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3107220?t=1770687030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3107220?t=1770687030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770687030","